msgid "Delivery attempts"
msgstr "Спроб доставки"

#: grunt/grunt/tasks/doctypes/BackgroundJob/BackgroundJob.json
msgctxt "help:BackgroundJob.delivery_count"
msgid ""
"How many times Redis re-delivered this task to a worker (transport level, "
"unrelated to the task's retry_on_error)."
msgstr ""
"Скільки разів Redis перепризначав цю задачу воркеру (транспортний рівень, не"
" пов'язано з retry_on_error задачі)."

